none of the aches and pain.

514
00:36:15,882 --> 00:36:18,008
No. l won't do this. l won't.

515
00:36:18,176 --> 00:36:19,844
CHARLl E:
l've never made this offer before.

516
00:36:20,011 --> 00:36:23,180
