l ain't Guttenberg and this ain't Cocoon.

530
00:37:09,603 --> 00:37:12,229
lmmortality. That's neat trick.

531
00:37:12,397 --> 00:37:13,564
lt's not a trick.

532
00:37:14,941 --> 00:37:16,025
lt's magic.

533
00:37:21,656 --> 00:37:23,824
Hey, bullet catch. Been working on that.

534
00:37:25,702 --> 00:37:26,869
DEAN :
Get him.

535
00:37:30,081 --> 00:37:32,082
Let him go! Now!

536
